{"quest_id": 7368, "name": "踊る提灯おばけ", "description": "王子たちは妖怪たちの狙いが大やぐらの\nある舞踊会場と知り、急ぎ現場に向かう。\nベラと共に暴れる提灯おばけを倒せ！\n極級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv25）", "event": "提灯おばけと夏夜の狩人", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920164, "map_no": 5881, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 90, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 16, "form_count": 2, "hp": 14500, "attack": 130, "base_hp": 14500, "base_attack": 130, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 5, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 20, "attack_interval": 90, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2129712, "race_id": 4, "special_effect_id": 70, "change_to": 1, "change_condition": 5, "missile_id": 563, "missile": {"speed": 17.0}, "master_id": 33867, "global_id": 7484, "to_condition": 5, "to_global_id": 7485}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "hp": 14500, "attack": 130, "base_hp": 14500, "base_attack": 130, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 5, "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 20, "attack_interval": 81, "move_speed": 300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 1, "pattern_id": 2129728, "race_id": 4, "special_effect_id": 823, "missile_id": 563, "missile": {"speed": 17.0}, "master_id": 33868, "global_id": 7485, "ranged": true, "from_condition": 5}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 750, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 750, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 141, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2099328, "race_id": 4, "master_id": 102, "global_id": 101}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 9, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5500, "attack": 900, "base_hp": 5500, "base_attack": 900, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 350, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 15, "attack_interval": 121, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2099344, "race_id": 4, "master_id": 103, "global_id": 102}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 20, "form_count": 1, "hp": 700, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 700, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 15, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2100288, "race_id": 4, "master_id": 237, "global_id": 236, "spawn_sec": 6}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 9500, "attack": 1500, "base_hp": 9500, "base_attack": 1500, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_range": 80, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 45, "attack_interval": 195, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2108688, "race_id": 4, "special_effect_id": 232, "missile_id": 11, "master_id": 30063, "global_id": 3682, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 76}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "提灯おばけ", "text": "──げぇっ！！　王子ッ！？", "face": "l07adf235cb1f"}, {"name": "フィリス", "text": "大人しくお縄についてもらおうか提灯おばけ。\n何を企んでいるのか知らないがこれ以上の狼藉は、\n祭りの警備隊長として見過ごすわけにはいかない。", "face": "u506"}, {"name": "提灯おばけ", "text": "くそぅ……完全に囲まれてやがる、\n足止めの連中は何をしてたんだ……。", "face": "l07adf235cb1f"}, {"name": "ベラ", "text": "観念しろー！　カンテラおばけー！", "face": "u1284a1"}, {"name": "提灯おばけ", "text": "提灯おばけだッ！！　二度と間違えるな！！", "face": "l07adf235cb1f"}, {"name": "提灯おばけ", "text": "ええい、こうなったらヤケだ！\nオイラだってやってやるんだからなぁ！\n覚悟しろ王子、お命ちょーだい！", "face": "l07adf235cb1f"}, {"name": "クーコ", "text": "あら怖い……でも、王子くんに手は出させないわよ？", "face": "u1282a1"}, {"name": "ベラ", "text": "アタシが相手になってやるぞー！\nかかってこーい！　ぼんぼりおばけー！", "face": "u1284a1"}, {"name": "提灯おばけ", "text": "わざとだろお前ーッ！？", "face": "l07adf235cb1f"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "提灯おばけ", "text": "うぇぇぇん！　痛いよぉ！\nたすけておやびーんっ！", "face": "l07adf235cb1f"}, {"name": "ベラ", "text": "あっ、泣いちゃった！", "face": "u1284a1"}, {"name": "レミィ", "text": "あの気の抜けた見た目も相まって、\nなんだかこっちがいじめてるみたいね……。", "face": "u1281a1"}, {"name": "ココロ", "text": "というかおやびんってまた……。\nこの件の黒幕がいるってことかな？", "face": "u1283a1"}, {"name": "チヨメ", "text": "──それについてはチヨメさんからご報告が。", "face": "u1144a1"}, {"name": "ココロ", "text": "うわぁ！　びっくりしたぁ！", "face": "u1283a1"}, {"name": "チヨメ", "text": "いやぁ、実は悪いご報告がありましてー。\nシズカ様とヨシノ様が妖怪たちの襲撃に遭い、\n現在戦闘中につき至急救援求むとのことですー。", "face": "u1144a1"}, {"name": "フィリス", "text": "──ッ！　くそっ、謀られたな……！", "face": "u506"}, {"name": "クーコ", "text": "陽動、だったみたいね。\n大軍を囮に王子くんの気を引いて、\n本命は別にあったってわけだ？", "face": "u1282a1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "今回の夏祭りの会場は二つ……。\n王国軍が主催するこの会場と──", "face": "lb55e36e273d3"}, {"name": "レミィ", "text": "──東の国と妖怪、両方の要人を招いた第二会場。\n人間と妖怪の友好の場、あいつらそれをぶち壊す気ね。", "face": "u1281a1"}, {"name": "クーコ", "text": "シズカとヨシノは東の国の最重要人物よ。\nもし二人の身に何かあれば最悪の場合……\n今まで積み上げた友好関係は全て台無しになるわ。", "face": "u1282a1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "そんな事態にさせるわけにはいきません。\n王子、至急お二人の救援に向かいましょう！", "face": "led10f7743cc0"}]}], "active": true}